{
  "Scenes.Kiha.HandleFear.FearShrugsOff": "Kiha shudders for a moment, then looks your way with a clear head. [say: Fear was the first thing the demons taught us to overcome. Do you think it would stay my blade?]\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFireBreath.AxeTossFlameBalls": "The draconic girl throws her trusty weapon into the sodden ground, using the distraction to build up balls of flame around her fists. She runs towards you, launching herself in your direction with a flurry of punches.\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFireBreath.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFireBreath.FireTornado": "Kiha throws her arms back and roars, exhaling a swirling tornado of fire directly at you!\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFireBreath.InfernoSlams": "You try to avoid the flames, but you're too slow! The inferno slams into you, setting you alight! You drop and roll on the ground, putting out the fires as fast as you can. As soon as the flames are out, you climb back up, smelling of smoke and soot."
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFirePunch.AxeTossFireFists": "The draconic girl throws her trusty weapon into the sodden ground, using the distraction to build up balls of flame around her fists. She runs towards you, launching herself in your direction with a flurry of punches.\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFirePunch.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaFirePunch.FirePunchHits": "Before you can react, you're struck by the power of her blows, feeling an intense pain in your chest as each fist makes contact. With a final thrust, you're pushed backwards onto the ground; the dragoness smiles as she pulls her axe out of the ground, her hands still steaming from the fingertips."
  "Scenes.Kiha.KihaTimeWaster.AxeShoulderStretch": "She supports the axe on a shoulder, cracking her neck and arching her back to stretch herself, giving you an unintended show."
  "Scenes.Kiha.PostAttack.FlameAfterwash": "\nAn afterwash of flames trails behind her blow, immolating you! "
  "Scenes.Kiha.React.BlindDefiantCry": "[pg][say: You think blindness will slow me down? Attacks like that are only effective on those who don't know how to see with their other senses!] Kiha cries defiantly."
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.AxeTossSprint": "Before you can stop to think, the dragon-woman steps back - throwing her axe into the air before she starts sprinting towards you. In seconds she's reached a hair's distance between her lithe form and your own, her fist recoiling and time seemingly stopping to allow you to note the powerful energy seeping from her arms. "
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.BakaCryFollow": "You follow the shrill cry of [say: B-BAKA!] in the distance until you reach the exact location you were in a few seconds earlier, prepared to fight again."
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.FightWord": "the fight"
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.FireFistTorrent": "A torrent of heat bursts from between her fingertips as she thrusts her clenched fist forward, the ball of intense flame writhing and burning with a fury unknown to mankind. With one fell swoop, the combined power of her love, anger, and sorrow pushes you backward, launching you out of the swamp and into Marble's pillowy chest. [say: Ara ara,] she begins, but you've already pushed yourself away from the milky hell-prison as you run back towards "
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.SharkCubeMemory": "You stifle a laugh as your memories turn to many an evening spent with your friends in front of your SharkCube console, contesting each other in games of ridiculous, stylized combat."
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.SlowMotionWalk": "You take the opportunity to walk away, watching the slow-motion attack unravel before you; the fire bursts from her knuckle in the shape of a bird in flight, wings unfurled. "
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.SwampWord": "the swamp"
  "Scenes.Kiha.SillyModeKihaAttack.XjasunReference": "You only owned an XJasun back home, so you don't really understand the reference."
  "Scenes.Kiha.Won.DisturbedLeaves": "[pg]Kiha seems visibly disturbed by your infection, enough that she turns to leave."
}
